  <RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.Closed>通知菜单已关闭</RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.Closed>
  <RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.NoTargetLocation>没有可用的目标位置</RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.NoTargetLocation>
  <RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.TargetNotValid>目标位置无效</RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.TargetNotValid>
  <RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.FailedToActivateButton>激活按钮失败</RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.FailedToActivateButton>
  <RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.FailedToJump>跳转到目标失败</RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.FailedToJump>
  <RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.OnlyLettersDeletable>只有信件可以删除</RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.OnlyLettersDeletable>
  <RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.CannotDeleteLetter>无法删除此信件</RimWorldAccess.Notifications.Menu.CannotDeleteLetter>

  <!-- Type labels for notifications. Used both as the prefix of the
